    "_about": "PROPOSED. How each surface answers a round. look names the impact recipe; size_mult scales the round's radius (a splash column is bigger than a dust puff from the same shell). Whatever a miss lands on is looked up in this table by what is under it (a unit's footprint, the bridge, the water, a tree's canopy, else the ground).",
