    "G4": {
      "label": "G4  Flash and one ring",
      "note": "The minimal family: a muzzle is a small knock-out flash, one ink ring and ONE soft white puff that drifts (so a big gun still smokes, once); an impact is a flash and one ring, coloured by material in ink and pale only (a pale ring on water, spark ticks on metal, three chips on stone). The calmest on a crowded turn (a tank fires every second), the cheapest to draw; the cost is that materials are told apart by little more than the ring and the flash.",
      "palette": {
        "roles": [
          "burst.core",
          "ink",
          "ink.ring",
          "gf.splash",
          "smoke.w.white.*",
          "gf.scorch",
          "gf.chip",
          "gf.leaf"
        ],
